codex
The root cause is confirmed: processes report an inner PID via `getpid`, while `/proc` exposes host PIDs (`NSpid` shows both). Lean constructs `/proc/<inner-pid>/exe`, so installation discovery fails. I’ll use a temporary preload shim outside the proof project that returns the host PID from `/proc/self/status`; this changes no Lean source, toolchain, dependency, or project configuration.
